      <tr><td style="border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px;">CognioNews Premium accounts: email address, name (from Stripe), preferences, subscription status, renewal or end date, and Stripe customer and subscription references</td><td style="border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px;">While your subscription is active, then 90 days after it ends. We check every subscription with Stripe about once a day</td></tr>
      <tr><td style="border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px;">Email addresses entered at Premium sign-in that do not belong to a Premium subscription</td><td style="border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px;">Deleted within about 25 hours. The security log keeps a record of the attempt for 12 months, in a form that does not reveal the address</td></tr>
      <tr><td style="border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px;">Billing and payment records (held by Stripe and in our accounts)</td><td style="border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px;">6 years from the end of the company financial year they relate to, because tax and company law require it</td></tr>
